This folder contains models for the following sugars:
- trehalose
- fructose
- glucose

By saying a model it meant that there are py-files with full descriptions of bonds, angles dihedrals, pairs and coordinates.
Every model is supported by a respective pdb-file.
Additionally for previously submitted model of sucrose there are two smaller simulation moxes which can be used for some test refinement of the systems.

3 other sugars are supported also by small simulation boxes of 27 and 64 molecules which can be directly used for some simulations.
Boxes are not equilibrated and need to be equilibrated before starting any proper refinement.
